---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Case Study: Media Ecosystem"
  description="Built a content ecosystem reaching 2M+ monthly impressions through culturally grounded editorial strategy."
  image="/logo.png"
>
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-4 md:px-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
      <span class="tag">Media</span>
      <span class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-sm">Case Study</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Media Ecosystem: Content Strategy at Scale</h1>
    <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-lg mb-8">Built a content ecosystem reaching 2M+ monthly impressions with culturally grounded storytelling.</p>

    <div class="w-full aspect-video rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 mb-12">
      <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/9579.jpeg`}" alt="Media Demo" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-10">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">The Challenge</h2>
        <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] leading-relaxed">
          A media brand needed to scale its content output without losing the cultural authenticity
          that made it resonate with its audience. The existing approach was fragmented and
          lacked a coherent editorial strategy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Our Approach</h2>
        <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We built an editorial framework rooted in South African cultural context, with
          AI-assisted content scheduling and distribution. The system balanced timely,
          culturally relevant content with evergreen brand pillars.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#F5F5F5]"><span class="text-[#DE656D] mt-1">&#10003;</span><span>Editorial calendar with AI-assisted topic ideation</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#F5F5F5]"><span class="text-[#DE656D] mt-1">&#10003;</span><span>Cultural fluency audit of all content pillars</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#F5F5F5]"><span class="text-[#DE656D] mt-1">&#10003;</span><span>Automated distribution across platforms and channels</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">The Results</h2>
        <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] leading-relaxed">
          The brand achieved 2M+ monthly impressions with a 45% increase in audience engagement
          and a 60% reduction in content production time.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Build Your Media Strategy</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>